@Cart_Service_HostAddress = http://localhost:5292
@token = paste-a-Customer-JWT-here
@storeId = 60000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@productId = 40000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@itemId = paste-a-cart-line-id-here

### Get the cart (empty carts return 200, not 404)
GET {{Cart_Service_HostAddress}}/?storeId={{storeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add an item; adding the same product again increases the existing line
POST {{Cart_Service_HostAddress}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{productId}}",
  "quantity": 2,
  "storeId": "{{storeId}}"
}

### Set an absolute quantity; 0 removes the line
PUT {{Cart_Service_HostAddress}}/items/{{itemId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 3,
  "storeId": "{{storeId}}"
}

### Remove a line
DELETE {{Cart_Service_HostAddress}}/items/{{itemId}}?storeId={{storeId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###
